.bazelrc.user
# The Playground (playground/, a module of its own): the staged compilers
# (playground/apple/playground_ios_application/build_embedded_toolchain.sh and
# playground/android/playground_android_application/stage_toolchain.sh, from
# compilers built by playground/tools/playground_toolchain; about 1 GB, far
# too large for git) and its SwiftPM resolution's checkouts. bazel-*, .build/,
# .swiftpm/, __pycache__/, *.xcodeproj/ and .bazelrc.user above cover it too.
playground/apple/playground_ios_application/embedded_toolchain/
playground/android/playground_android_application/toolchain/
playground/third_party/swift_packages/.build
